    {"id": "lights_for_wickhollow", "name": "Lights for Wickhollow", "giver": "mabel",
     "intro": "Oh, a new face! The lamps keep going out and the Bramblets keep nibbling my posts. Could you fetch some logs, make yourself a little sword, and shoo a few Bramblets away?",
